      },
      {
        "id": 133,
        "name": "Google Shape;133;p3",
        "text": "Idea / Solution: Dual-rail autonomous engine combining deterministic sandbox probes with bounded AI explanation.\nDirect PS16 Alignment: Normalizes scans, eliminates duplicates, safely probes targets, calculates math-based risk, and enforces human approval.",
